  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Halo collection is named for its unique ring-shaped hardware—an archival detail that dates back to Kate and Andy Spade's early days in business. This mini style can be worn four ways—a bucket bag or wristlet, over-the-shoulder or cross-body.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Fine grain leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 5&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 22.4&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Dog clip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Hardware: Argento (Pale Citron, Cream, Black) Pale Gold (Light Cantaloupe) Can be worn as a wristlet, top handle satchel, shoulder bag, or crossbody bag</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 6.1&quot; (L) x 7.4&quot; (H) x 3.70&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
